(5982790, 875929, 99981, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. The DOF is amazing, i''ll be back to see which aperture you used for this one. Nice tones, great light and discrete but nice colors at the grass. Good work and good luck, i hope you do well. <br/>Added to my favorites, by the way.</td>', 'Stunning image. The DOF is amazing, i''ll be back to see which aperture you used for this one. Nice tones, great light and discrete but nice colors at the grass. Good work and good luck, i hope you do well. Added to my favorites, by the way.', '2010-05-01 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982792, 875635, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!  That lotus blossom. Holy crap.  This is stellar.  I love how the white of the flower mimics the white of the clouds.  What a stunning tri-tone.  WOW WOW WOW!! 10</td>', 'Oh my!!  That lotus blossom. Holy crap.  This is stellar.  I love how the white of the flower mimics the white of the clouds.  What a stunning tri-tone.  WOW WOW WOW!! 10', '2010-05-01 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982794, 870564, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  Excellent textures.</td>', 'Really beautiful.  Excellent textures.', '2010-05-01 12:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982795, 876125, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset lighting on the mother''s neck, face and leg.  I love that the colt is looking right at you.  I wonder if you worked on curves a bit to deepen the sky?  Just thinking out loud. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset lighting on the mother''s neck, face and leg.  I love that the colt is looking right at you.  I wonder if you worked on curves a bit to deepen the sky?  Just thinking out loud. Nicely done.', '2010-05-01 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
