(5982798, 867438, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I like how the negative space/blue bokeh compliments the pink of the flower.  Wonderful lighting and focus and narrow DOF.</td>', 'Lovely.  I like how the negative space/blue bokeh compliments the pink of the flower.  Wonderful lighting and focus and narrow DOF.', '2010-05-01 12:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
