(5983050, 875699, 113900, '<td valign="top">Everything I read tells me to focus on the eyes when taking a portrait.  Now I know why.  Absolutely stunning shot.  Some may complain about the upper left being so dark but I think it works well with the composition.  My favorite shot yet in this FS.  A very well deserved 10</td>', 'Everything I read tells me to focus on the eyes when taking a portrait.  Now I know why.  Absolutely stunning shot.  Some may complain about the upper left being so dark but I think it works well with the composition.  My favorite shot yet in this FS.  A very well deserved 10', '2010-05-01 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
