(5984078, 875817, 113419, '<td valign="top">the lighting in this image is wonderful and overall it''s a beautiful image; my only suggestions for improvement might be the angle at which this was shot; at this angle you lose all of the neck; so the illusion is that this horse has a very short neck; the horse looks to be Arabian so that probably isn''t true; the angle is also causing some type of distortion of the chest; I believe a crop just under the muzzle and and at the end of the nose would have corrected both these illusions - I''m scoring this at an 8</td>', 'the lighting in this image is wonderful and overall it''s a beautiful image; my only suggestions for improvement might be the angle at which this was shot; at this angle you lose all of the neck; so the illusion is that this horse has a very short neck; the horse looks to be Arabian so that probably isn''t true; the angle is also causing some type of distortion of the chest; I believe a crop just under the muzzle and and at the end of the nose would have corrected both these illusions - I''m scoring this at an 8', '2010-05-02 09:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
