(5986512, 875729, 40391, '<td valign="top">Believe it or not but I noticed her eyes first ;-)<br/> <br/>Her left eye is a little too out of sync with the right - but I''m sure I won''t be the only one to comment about this. You probably know any way which is why you probably didn''t use this in the other challenge (yes - she''s a little recognisable).  Otherwise, nice pose, good lighting and just the right amount of softness (as well as a good model) leads to a good shot. 6 from me.</td>', 'Believe it or not but I noticed her eyes first ;-) Her left eye is a little too out of sync with the right - but I''m sure I won''t be the only one to comment about this. You probably know any way which is why you probably didn''t use this in the other challenge (yes - she''s a little recognisable).  Otherwise, nice pose, good lighting and just the right amount of softness (as well as a good model) leads to a good shot. 6 from me.', '2010-05-03 04:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
