(5986549, 875753, 40391, '<td valign="top">So what were you going for origanally - Double Exposure or Fasion? ;-)<br/> <br/>Good capture and lighting.  Her upper arm has something unusual happening. If it''s natural then you did the right thing leaving it in IMHO. If it''s a result of lighting then you should have removed it.<br/> <br/>Judging by the quality of the shot I believe it is her and I''m judging accordingly. 7.</td>', 'So what were you going for origanally - Double Exposure or Fasion? ;-) Good capture and lighting.  Her upper arm has something unusual happening. If it''s natural then you did the right thing leaving it in IMHO. If it''s a result of lighting then you should have removed it. Judging by the quality of the shot I believe it is her and I''m judging accordingly. 7.', '2010-05-03 05:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
