(5987705, 872847, 22384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject and nice use of color to enhance those brilliantly blue eyes. The red on the microphone distracts a bit because you do such an excellent job of blending the mic with the background, leaving just a hint of it which also draws the viewer''s eyes to your subject. 7</td>', 'Beautiful subject and nice use of color to enhance those brilliantly blue eyes. The red on the microphone distracts a bit because you do such an excellent job of blending the mic with the background, leaving just a hint of it which also draws the viewer''s eyes to your subject. 7', '2010-05-03 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
