(5987712, 874398, 22384, '<td valign="top">Wow, intense and interesting image. I did a double-take, which, for me, is a good thing. I would move the focal point a bit to align it with "rule of thirds."</td>', 'Wow, intense and interesting image. I did a double-take, which, for me, is a good thing. I would move the focal point a bit to align it with "rule of thirds."', '2010-05-03 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
