(5987786, 876127, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism here. Usually composing with the subjects pushed to the edge of the frame is awkward looking, but it just seems to work for this. Could be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> entry. If this is not Deb, then take that as a compliment.</td>', 'I like the minimalism here. Usually composing with the subjects pushed to the edge of the frame is awkward looking, but it just seems to work for this. Could be a  Melethia entry. If this is not Deb, then take that as a compliment.', '2010-05-03 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5987790, 875816, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lighting on her face seems a little unflattering to me. Some moderate softening could help it come off better, I think. Otherwise, a nicely done portrait and probably better than I could do.</td>', 'Lighting on her face seems a little unflattering to me. Some moderate softening could help it come off better, I think. Otherwise, a nicely done portrait and probably better than I could do.', '2010-05-03 14:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
