(5989177, 875729, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''ve got nothing against breasts, but I think this would be a much better composition if you cropped right above her cleavage.  Or, you could give us the portion from right above the cleavage.  I feel as if I''m looking at two different pictures.</td>', 'I''ve got nothing against breasts, but I think this would be a much better composition if you cropped right above her cleavage.  Or, you could give us the portion from right above the cleavage.  I feel as if I''m looking at two different pictures.', '2010-05-04 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989186, 875729, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice saucy shot. Don''t forget to pay attention to your background though as the mirror and bright sky do wash out her hair a little bit.</td>', 'nice saucy shot. Don''t forget to pay attention to your background though as the mirror and bright sky do wash out her hair a little bit.', '2010-05-04 10:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989188, 876117, 35545, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have some interesting detail here, but it''s so dark I can''t see it very well.</td>', 'Looks like you have some interesting detail here, but it''s so dark I can''t see it very well.', '2010-05-04 10:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989190, 874220, 35545, '<td valign="top">Busy.  Busy.  Busy.  I don''t know what I''m supposed to look at.  Nice details and tonal range.</td>', 'Busy.  Busy.  Busy.  I don''t know what I''m supposed to look at.  Nice details and tonal range.', '2010-05-04 10:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989192, 876066, 104841, '<td valign="top">wow what a really interesting beach. I am a little bit uneasy with your shot. I don''t know if this is the right angle to capture it from or if you have included too much bland sky.</td>', 'wow what a really interesting beach. I am a little bit uneasy with your shot. I don''t know if this is the right angle to capture it from or if you have included too much bland sky.', '2010-05-04 10:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989194, 875301, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice twilight shot, but I really had to look for the moon.  (Didn''t mark down for that...)   8)</td>', 'Nice twilight shot, but I really had to look for the moon.  (Didn''t mark down for that...)   8)', '2010-05-04 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989197, 875975, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene and colors, but could do with less processing.</td>', 'Interesting scene and colors, but could do with less processing.', '2010-05-04 10:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989203, 873663, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, but the building looks tilted to the right.  Nice colors and reflections in the water.</td>', 'Nice night shot, but the building looks tilted to the right.  Nice colors and reflections in the water.', '2010-05-04 10:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989204, 876079, 35545, '<td valign="top">Recycled?</td>', 'Recycled?', '2010-05-04 10:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989205, 875343, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like how the water has turned out in your shot. You might have been able to improve the shot slightly by turning the camera slightly further left but that is just nit picking.</td>', 'I really like how the water has turned out in your shot. You might have been able to improve the shot slightly by turning the camera slightly further left but that is just nit picking.', '2010-05-04 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989206, 867996, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail in the fur and eyes, but IMNSHO, having him peer out of the frame is very distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful detail in the fur and eyes, but IMNSHO, having him peer out of the frame is very distracting.', '2010-05-04 10:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989207, 872056, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the bird, but IMNSHO too much background.</td>', 'Nice capture of the bird, but IMNSHO too much background.', '2010-05-04 10:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989209, 875620, 35545, '<td valign="top">I am not one of the "tack sharp" police, but the lamb needs to be in better focus.  Interesting tactic to have him framed by the sheep in the foreground.</td>', 'I am not one of the "tack sharp" police, but the lamb needs to be in better focus.  Interesting tactic to have him framed by the sheep in the foreground.', '2010-05-04 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989210, 876039, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and colors.  Maybe get rid of the roof and paraphernalia in the lower right.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and colors.  Maybe get rid of the roof and paraphernalia in the lower right.', '2010-05-04 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989245, 875936, 104841, '<td valign="top">This is a rather good portrait you have made here. The closed fist is at odds with the elegant feminine pose. On a technical note you may have burnt out some of the facial highlights so use softer light and for more even lighting you may want to reflect some light onto her back.</td>', 'This is a rather good portrait you have made here. The closed fist is at odds with the elegant feminine pose. On a technical note you may have burnt out some of the facial highlights so use softer light and for more even lighting you may want to reflect some light onto her back.', '2010-05-04 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989250, 875318, 104841, '<td valign="top">really cool rock formation, that one in the right even has half a face in it. You might want to remove those red patches in the back ground.</td>', 'really cool rock formation, that one in the right even has half a face in it. You might want to remove those red patches in the back ground.', '2010-05-04 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989297, 875369, 113214, '<td valign="top">Stunning image....very soft quality / natural / and light feel to it. I had a few 9s in this challenge, but this is my only 10.</td>', 'Stunning image....very soft quality / natural / and light feel to it. I had a few 9s in this challenge, but this is my only 10.', '2010-05-04 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989411, 865800, 83313, '<td valign="top">Strange and very different. I like it.</td>', 'Strange and very different. I like it.', '2010-05-04 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989413, 875446, 83313, '<td valign="top">Watch your JPEG compression amount. I see the beginning of some compression artifacts in her face. At 188k file size, you could have used less compression and avoided that. Compression kills detail. Always use the least you can and still fit into the challenge limits.</td>', 'Watch your JPEG compression amount. I see the beginning of some compression artifacts in her face. At 188k file size, you could have used less compression and avoided that. Compression kills detail. Always use the least you can and still fit into the challenge limits.', '2010-05-04 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989417, 875812, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the overall scene, but I think you went overboard on the processing. It looks like the boy was cut and pasted into the scene.</td>', 'I like the overall scene, but I think you went overboard on the processing. It looks like the boy was cut and pasted into the scene.', '2010-05-04 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989420, 874883, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but if I could nitpick, I don''t feel the selective desat was right for it. Both the color and mono areas look great, they just don''t look right together to me.</td>', 'I like the shot, but if I could nitpick, I don''t feel the selective desat was right for it. Both the color and mono areas look great, they just don''t look right together to me.', '2010-05-04 13:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989439, 875847, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has been longtime, but Grog is pleased to see hometown again. How is old man Oog doing? And Looga? At 18 sun cycles Looga still had most of teeth left. Very beautiful. Many wanted her. Grog remembers well.</td>', 'Has been longtime, but Grog is pleased to see hometown again. How is old man Oog doing? And Looga? At 18 sun cycles Looga still had most of teeth left. Very beautiful. Many wanted her. Grog remembers well.', '2010-05-04 13:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989451, 874541, 115676, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture tells a powerful story!</td>', 'Wow, this picture tells a powerful story!', '2010-05-04 13:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989453, 873425, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad to see you entered this one. Very nice portrait of a pretty woman. As often as I have seen her now, I am assuming this is your wife? (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'Glad to see you entered this one. Very nice portrait of a pretty woman. As often as I have seen her now, I am assuming this is your wife? (No vote, comment only)', '2010-05-04 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989454, 874353, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a moment! And perfect light on top of it. I am curious if this just happened and you snapped the moment, or if it was staged. Either way, I love it.</td>', 'What a moment! And perfect light on top of it. I am curious if this just happened and you snapped the moment, or if it was staged. Either way, I love it.', '2010-05-04 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989457, 874541, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a story here.</td>', 'There is a story here.', '2010-05-04 14:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5989460, 876075, 82104, '<td valign="top">The art of a steady hand! Super shot.</td>', 'The art of a steady hand! Super shot.', '2010-05-04 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1);
