(5994713, 875922, 64086, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The light on bottom three foreground layers is really beautiful. I would consider cropping just below the bright diamond at the top or maybe making it less intense in pp. If you crop you lose the nice area just to the left of it, but I think it''s still a nice composition.</td>', 'Great photo. The light on bottom three foreground layers is really beautiful. I would consider cropping just below the bright diamond at the top or maybe making it less intense in pp. If you crop you lose the nice area just to the left of it, but I think it''s still a nice composition.', '2010-05-06 19:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
