(5994813, 876036, 51747, '<td valign="top">WOW  One of my faves of the challenge.</td>', 'WOW  One of my faves of the challenge.', '2010-05-06 21:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994822, 864917, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautiful coloration and composition, love the warmth and clarity in your image. I really like the way we can see the plane of focus across the image too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all<br/> <br/>Overall: A well conceived and executed image that stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Beautiful coloration and composition, love the warmth and clarity in your image. I really like the way we can see the plane of focus across the image too. Critical stuff: Nothing at all Overall: A well conceived and executed image that stands out from the crowd.', '2010-05-06 21:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994828, 876127, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Guessing this is Rachel - great tones; an image full of subtlety - I like the shadows of the people, that curve of darkness on the left car and the reflections of the people in the right car; all very compelling.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: a very well crafted image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Guessing this is Rachel - great tones; an image full of subtlety - I like the shadows of the people, that curve of darkness on the left car and the reflections of the people in the right car; all very compelling. Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: a very well crafted image.', '2010-05-06 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994831, 875562, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet picture and an engaging scene.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop out the left side of the image, because there''s ''nothing'' there.  Then the child and the printing would take center stage.  In my book, it''s still easily a 6.</td>', 'This is a sweet picture and an engaging scene.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop out the left side of the image, because there''s ''nothing'' there.  Then the child and the printing would take center stage.  In my book, it''s still easily a 6.', '2010-05-06 21:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994835, 873663, 14476, '<td valign="top">All those lovely geometric shapes.  If this was mine, I''d probably straighten up those edges with a slight Rotate in PS.   Still it was good seeing and a fun image.</td>', 'All those lovely geometric shapes.  If this was mine, I''d probably straighten up those edges with a slight Rotate in PS.   Still it was good seeing and a fun image.', '2010-05-06 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
