(5994843, 871710, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great confidence in your subject to present it in such a bold manner - I like that. It has a very nice colour palette too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It seems rather ''smooth'', I think a bit higher local contrast may have helped bring out some of the texture a bit more effectively.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great confidence in your subject to present it in such a bold manner - I like that. It has a very nice colour palette too. Critical stuff: It seems rather ''smooth'', I think a bit higher local contrast may have helped bring out some of the texture a bit more effectively. Overall: Very nice work.', '2010-05-06 22:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994847, 875299, 14476, '<td valign="top">Pity the poor seabirds.  Nowhere to light.  <br/>:-))<br/> <br/>Okay, humor over with, this is an exceptional capture of a scene that many would pass by - to their loss.  <br/> <br/>Exceptional work.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Pity the poor seabirds.  Nowhere to light.  :-)) Okay, humor over with, this is an exceptional capture of a scene that many would pass by - to their loss.   Exceptional work.  Congratulations.', '2010-05-06 22:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
