(5996573, 876128, 63218, '<td valign="top">The starkly romantic contrast of white petals against the dark BG creates an intriguing mystery of light for my eyes to enjoy. The crisp green leaf emphasizes the alabaster whiteness. I am thinking of a full moon in a clouded night sky. Not a big fan of the letterbox border, so I am ignoring it. For outstanding achievement in flower photography, I am humbly offering you my admiration &amp; the Gilded Lily.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=832149" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The starkly romantic contrast of white petals against the dark BG creates an intriguing mystery of light for my eyes to enjoy. The crisp green leaf emphasizes the alabaster whiteness. I am thinking of a full moon in a clouded night sky. Not a big fan of the letterbox border, so I am ignoring it. For outstanding achievement in flower photography, I am humbly offering you my admiration & the Gilded Lily.', '2010-05-08 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996574, 874504, 63218, '<td valign="top">Mostly shadows, how interesting.</td>', 'Mostly shadows, how interesting.', '2010-05-08 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996586, 876001, 63218, '<td valign="top">It looks so alive &amp; thrumming with energy &amp; just look at the light you''ve captured. Not to mention the color. The details of the petal tips hold my attention, it''s a visual mystery I can''t resolve. I halfway expect to see it breathe right here on my screen. For excellence in flower photography, for illustrating the abiding mystery that you can find any day in your own garden, I humbly offer my admiration &amp; the Gilded Lily.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=832149" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_832149.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It looks so alive & thrumming with energy & just look at the light you''ve captured. Not to mention the color. The details of the petal tips hold my attention, it''s a visual mystery I can''t resolve. I halfway expect to see it breathe right here on my screen. For excellence in flower photography, for illustrating the abiding mystery that you can find any day in your own garden, I humbly offer my admiration & the Gilded Lily.', '2010-05-08 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996589, 876115, 63218, '<td valign="top">A bejeweled curve of creamy whiteness.</td>', 'A bejeweled curve of creamy whiteness.', '2010-05-08 00:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
