(5996603, 875941, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is darling. If only I had macro eyes, I could see stuff like this on my own.  This could be an illustration in a sophisticated children''s book, one with pictures only. The flower with its tiger strips is just as alive as the little family &amp; the color is subtly wonderful.</td>', 'This is darling. If only I had macro eyes, I could see stuff like this on my own.  This could be an illustration in a sophisticated children''s book, one with pictures only. The flower with its tiger strips is just as alive as the little family & the color is subtly wonderful.', '2010-05-08 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
