(5996908, 867395, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally add ribbons to my favorites anymore, because I generally think they''re pretty bleh. This one though is incredible. There''s not a single thing I can come up with that I would suggest to improve it. The pose is brilliantly unique, the facial expression is perfect, and the lighting is very fitting. The slight blur of the hand bugged me for half a second, and then I realized that''s part of the reason I like the photo so much. It almost makes it appear like she''s levitating even though she''s clearly touching the ground. I can''t explain it, but I love it.</td>', 'I don''t normally add ribbons to my favorites anymore, because I generally think they''re pretty bleh. This one though is incredible. There''s not a single thing I can come up with that I would suggest to improve it. The pose is brilliantly unique, the facial expression is perfect, and the lighting is very fitting. The slight blur of the hand bugged me for half a second, and then I realized that''s part of the reason I like the photo so much. It almost makes it appear like she''s levitating even though she''s clearly touching the ground. I can''t explain it, but I love it.', '2010-05-08 05:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
