(5997240, 875943, 74979, '<td valign="top">hmmm..not sure what you mean <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68504" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tnun</a>..no brushes here, just some levels and other basic moves..<br/>wish someone would tell me why this didnt break 5!  is it my monitor?<br/> <br/>ahh well!</td>', 'hmmm..not sure what you mean  tnun..no brushes here, just some levels and other basic moves..wish someone would tell me why this didnt break 5!  is it my monitor? ahh well!', '2010-05-08 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
