(5997246, 875943, 68504, '<td valign="top">I meant it looked like a painting. (I am a pp ignoramus - totally forgot there are brushes there too!).  And this is a very tough crowd these days.</td>', 'I meant it looked like a painting. (I am a pp ignoramus - totally forgot there are brushes there too!).  And this is a very tough crowd these days.', '2010-05-08 13:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
