(5997253, 872804, 40490, '<td valign="top">Leave the cropped corners, that was the effect you were going for, wasn''t it? I believe I''ve seen a style like this before. It looks very creative, I think.  If I would change one thing, it would be the intensity of the blue sky in the upper-left of the photograph (around 11 o''clock, if your photo was an analog clock). It''s a bit too blue and seems to take away from the image.<br/> <br/>Sorry I didn''t vote during this contest, this photo deserves better than it got.</td>', 'Leave the cropped corners, that was the effect you were going for, wasn''t it? I believe I''ve seen a style like this before. It looks very creative, I think.  If I would change one thing, it would be the intensity of the blue sky in the upper-left of the photograph (around 11 o''clock, if your photo was an analog clock). It''s a bit too blue and seems to take away from the image. Sorry I didn''t vote during this contest, this photo deserves better than it got.', '2010-05-08 13:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997256, 865775, 83795, '<td valign="top">394th out of 394.....nowhere to go but up from here!!!!</td>', '394th out of 394.....nowhere to go but up from here!!!!', '2010-05-08 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
