(5997409, 871834, 27164, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I''m impressed that you were able to get the symmetry so precise.</td>', 'Very nice - I''m impressed that you were able to get the symmetry so precise.', '2010-05-08 15:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997416, 875998, 27164, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shadows.  I''d be curious to see how this looks in color.</td>', 'Wonderful shadows.  I''d be curious to see how this looks in color.', '2010-05-08 15:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997417, 864825, 77305, '<td valign="top">I expected this to do better as well. Awesome idea.<br/>And I think you should get this printed on your wall. and print it on aluminum :)</td>', 'I expected this to do better as well. Awesome idea.And I think you should get this printed on your wall. and print it on aluminum :)', '2010-05-08 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997443, 867395, 60910, '<td valign="top">magnificent, well deserved win... the tones are INCREDIBLE!!!  would love to know your post processing, software, etc...</td>', 'magnificent, well deserved win... the tones are INCREDIBLE!!!  would love to know your post processing, software, etc...', '2010-05-08 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997454, 874589, 64086, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I think the focus on the left side of bench brings my eye to it and the soft edges and the motion in the foreground make me look out into the ocean at the birds as if I were sitting there. I also think the toning of the post processing adds to the mood. Great shot.</td>', 'I really like this. I think the focus on the left side of bench brings my eye to it and the soft edges and the motion in the foreground make me look out into the ocean at the birds as if I were sitting there. I also think the toning of the post processing adds to the mood. Great shot.', '2010-05-08 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997457, 875753, 64086, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition and lighting. Great Job!</td>', 'Awesome composition and lighting. Great Job!', '2010-05-08 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997460, 868165, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Lorie. You deserved every point you got and then some! I''m so happy for you. Very strong portrait, and so interesting as well.</td>', 'Congratulations, Lorie. You deserved every point you got and then some! I''m so happy for you. Very strong portrait, and so interesting as well.', '2010-05-08 16:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997462, 875838, 57202, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo!  I can''t convey how much I love this shot. :D  Now THIS is a long exposure done right.  Added to favorites and bookmarked in my Inspiration folder.</td>', 'Incredible photo!  I can''t convey how much I love this shot. :D  Now THIS is a long exposure done right.  Added to favorites and bookmarked in my Inspiration folder.', '2010-05-08 16:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997463, 876123, 64086, '<td valign="top">Great photo and processing. I love the contrast of the smooth water and the detailed rocks. One my top votes in the fs.</td>', 'Great photo and processing. I love the contrast of the smooth water and the detailed rocks. One my top votes in the fs.', '2010-05-08 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997467, 876117, 64086, '<td valign="top">This is so good. Should have placed much higher.</td>', 'This is so good. Should have placed much higher.', '2010-05-08 16:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997470, 867395, 57202, '<td valign="top">WELL deserved blue! :D</td>', 'WELL deserved blue! :D', '2010-05-08 16:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997476, 865165, 64086, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! Perfect composition. I love the desaturation, the tack sharp subject and the dreamy background.</td>', 'This is awesome! Perfect composition. I love the desaturation, the tack sharp subject and the dreamy background.', '2010-05-08 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997483, 866597, 64086, '<td valign="top">Love the toning. Great composition. Should have done much better.</td>', 'Love the toning. Great composition. Should have done much better.', '2010-05-08 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997484, 875635, 64086, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, congratulations on 4th.</td>', 'Amazing shot, congratulations on 4th.', '2010-05-08 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997489, 875838, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a photo to be proud of, a truly unique image. I see that you had the camera facing north east, from the trails.  It must be very dark there at night for you to do this at 5.6 and almost 3 hours, or perhaps done with a N D filter.  The 7D did an awesome job with keeping the noise low. <br/>I am guessing that the windmill is a 1/4 or 1/2 scale model, as I see what looks like a bench seat in front of it. <br/>Thanks for adding the details about how it was done. I salute you for your patience and careful planning. You were rewarded with a very memorable night and an outstanding image for your effort. <br/></td>', 'This is a photo to be proud of, a truly unique image. I see that you had the camera facing north east, from the trails.  It must be very dark there at night for you to do this at 5.6 and almost 3 hours, or perhaps done with a N D filter.  The 7D did an awesome job with keeping the noise low. I am guessing that the windmill is a 1/4 or 1/2 scale model, as I see what looks like a bench seat in front of it. Thanks for adding the details about how it was done. I salute you for your patience and careful planning. You were rewarded with a very memorable night and an outstanding image for your effort. ', '2010-05-08 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997551, 872056, 103142, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think it''s absolutely ridiculous that this scored so low.  I think it''s a stunning image. I think ursula is right--that it''s too contrasty. I''d be curious what would happen if you did shadows/highlights on it in photoshop and took down the highlights a tad to flatten it out. It also would have been 100% better if you were able to shoot to the left so that the bird was in the lower right, instead of the lower center. However, as bird person, I think that it is a stunning shot!</td>', 'Personally, I think it''s absolutely ridiculous that this scored so low.  I think it''s a stunning image. I think ursula is right--that it''s too contrasty. I''d be curious what would happen if you did shadows/highlights on it in photoshop and took down the highlights a tad to flatten it out. It also would have been 100% better if you were able to shoot to the left so that the bird was in the lower right, instead of the lower center. However, as bird person, I think that it is a stunning shot!', '2010-05-08 17:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997598, 875838, 96751, '<td valign="top">THAT''s dedication.  Clearly it payed off.  Congrats!</td>', 'THAT''s dedication.  Clearly it payed off.  Congrats!', '2010-05-08 18:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997609, 876003, 40490, '<td valign="top">The barely visible shade of blue in the jay''s wings captures my eyes in this image. Very nice. ... perhaps it could have been a trifle sharper?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-08 17:19:39.</i></td>', 'The barely visible shade of blue in the jay''s wings captures my eyes in this image. Very nice. ... perhaps it could have been a trifle sharper?', '2010-05-08 18:19:21.000000', '2010-05-08 18:19:39.000000', 0),
(5997626, 876117, 17507, '<td valign="top">This really is far better than the score would seem to indicate.</td>', 'This really is far better than the score would seem to indicate.', '2010-05-08 18:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997632, 875631, 107922, '<td valign="top">It''s been a pleasure to study this image.  Outstanding in detail, clarity &amp; tonal range.  I think what really does it for me though, is the wonderful symmetry in the straight &amp; diagonal lines and the converging point across the river.  I think it needs to been seen printed LARGE to really appreciate it.  Fine job!</td>', 'It''s been a pleasure to study this image.  Outstanding in detail, clarity & tonal range.  I think what really does it for me though, is the wonderful symmetry in the straight & diagonal lines and the converging point across the river.  I think it needs to been seen printed LARGE to really appreciate it.  Fine job!', '2010-05-08 18:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997643, 875583, 117427, '<td valign="top">Love the expression of the eyes. Nice capture.</td>', 'Love the expression of the eyes. Nice capture.', '2010-05-08 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997644, 867395, 30982, '<td valign="top">She really can balance that way?  This is simply fascinating to me.  Wonderful!</td>', 'She really can balance that way?  This is simply fascinating to me.  Wonderful!', '2010-05-08 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997667, 875817, 117427, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition</td>', 'Stunning composition', '2010-05-08 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997733, 876119, 75034, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Shutter-For-Hire:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you!!!<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Originally posted by Shutter-For-Hire: Nicely done!   Thank you!!! MAX!', '2010-05-08 20:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997740, 867395, 7893, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a perfect balance pose! Its really looks like that she is trying to balance the last few grams of her body with her fingers.Amazing!</td>', 'Wow! This is a perfect balance pose! Its really looks like that she is trying to balance the last few grams of her body with her fingers.Amazing!', '2010-05-08 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997767, 867395, 112739, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win, the new PB, and an outstanding image! Your work is just amazing and jaw dropping.  wow!</td>', 'Congrats on the win, the new PB, and an outstanding image! Your work is just amazing and jaw dropping.  wow!', '2010-05-08 21:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997770, 875985, 116674, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alfresco:</b></div><hr/><i> My opinion on why it scored "low" - no good separation between the subject and the background.  That was my first impression when I opened the image, and that impression stuck with me for about five seconds.  As voting goes that''s about as much time as you get (unfortunately).  <br/> <br/>In a different environment where the viewer is not constrained by time the "score" (read: overall impression) may be higher.  <br/> <br/>I still feel the photo''s background detracts from the subject instead of enhancing the subject.<br/> <br/>Anyway - my two cents! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totally agree <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=29490" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">alfresco</a> and I''d even go one step further. Isolate and darken the background as much as possible. Leave just a hint of what the background might be so the viewer almost has to guess. The longer someone looks at you photo the higher the score. (Most of the time LOL)</td>', 'Originally posted by alfresco: My opinion on why it scored "low" - no good separation between the subject and the background.  That was my first impression when I opened the image, and that impression stuck with me for about five seconds.  As voting goes that''s about as much time as you get (unfortunately).   In a different environment where the viewer is not constrained by time the "score" (read: overall impression) may be higher.   I still feel the photo''s background detracts from the subject instead of enhancing the subject. Anyway - my two cents! :)   Totally agree  alfresco and I''d even go one step further. Isolate and darken the background as much as possible. Leave just a hint of what the background might be so the viewer almost has to guess. The longer someone looks at you photo the higher the score. (Most of the time LOL)', '2010-05-08 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
