(6013524, 876125, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene - love that the little one is watching you.<br/> <br/>I think in your effort to boost the details and color intensity of your shot, you ended up severely pixelating the image. This is especially noticeable in the coat of the horses - there is the classic green and pink pixel noise that is a red flag for ''overprocessed''. I think this is what really cost you significantly.</td>', 'Wonderful scene - love that the little one is watching you. I think in your effort to boost the details and color intensity of your shot, you ended up severely pixelating the image. This is especially noticeable in the coat of the horses - there is the classic green and pink pixel noise that is a red flag for ''overprocessed''. I think this is what really cost you significantly.', '2010-05-18 20:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
