(6020459, 875915, 16912, '<td valign="top">I am kind of disappointed though, I just finished my first round of PS CS5 training, and what a difference knowing how to PROPERLY use that software makes! I wish I would have been able to edit this photo again..... <br/> <br/>Al, your challenge from me (should you wish to accept it) is to re edit this shot knowing what you recently learnt, start a thread in the forum with both versions and let the unwashed masses decide if your learning ;)</td>', 'I am kind of disappointed though, I just finished my first round of PS CS5 training, and what a difference knowing how to PROPERLY use that software makes! I wish I would have been able to edit this photo again.....  Al, your challenge from me (should you wish to accept it) is to re edit this shot knowing what you recently learnt, start a thread in the forum with both versions and let the unwashed masses decide if your learning ;)', '2010-05-21 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
