(6092712, 868165, 75713, '<td valign="top">This is a striking photo.  I love that he is dressed in full regalia. The beadwork on his head dress looks spectacular. What Nation I wonder?  For years I worked with the people of the Mi''kmag Nation and loved the pow wows.</td>', 'This is a striking photo.  I love that he is dressed in full regalia. The beadwork on his head dress looks spectacular. What Nation I wonder?  For years I worked with the people of the Mi''kmag Nation and loved the pow wows.', '2010-07-14 13:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6095902, 874883, 40718, '<td valign="top">So it turns out this is a great picture because I was just there today and the lower section is completely closed until 2013 for remodeling.  You could only shoot from the top! :(</td>', 'So it turns out this is a great picture because I was just there today and the lower section is completely closed until 2013 for remodeling.  You could only shoot from the top! :(', '2010-07-17 22:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
