(6268189, 871046, 68947, '<td valign="top">I find it interesting that the non-participants scored this lower than the participants.  The commenters show their appreciation of such a lovely and captivating shot.  I really think that this should have scored higher but, 33rd place out of nearly 400 entries is a fabulous finish!  Congrats!</td>', 'I find it interesting that the non-participants scored this lower than the participants.  The commenters show their appreciation of such a lovely and captivating shot.  I really think that this should have scored higher but, 33rd place out of nearly 400 entries is a fabulous finish!  Congrats!', '2011-01-02 23:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
